 R←Test_Dir2_008(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list
⍝ Test the `Dir2` method with wildcards in invalid places
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :Trap 0
     {}##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 ∆Home,'/Second/*/*_?????'
     →T.PassesIf 0
 :Else
     :If 'Win'≡APLTreeUtils2.GetOperatingSystem ⍬
         →T.PassesIf∨/'Wildcard characters are allowed only after the last "\"'⍷⊃⎕DM
     :Else
         →T.PassesIf∨/'Wildcard characters are allowed only after the last "/"'⍷⊃⎕DM
     :EndIf
 :EndTrap

 R←T._OK
